(892,1648,$mw$80E64224734653D32E28497B8D05FA6E20D77DB64E35FF7830D74594EDAF1C9E$mw$,$mw$aaed56e924be80bf26949d4d78cadf87$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1648,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":24,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"متى تكون العبارة $P\\Rightarrow Q$ كاذبة؟","TitleEn":"When is $P\\Rightarrow Q$ false?","QuestionTextAr":"متى تكون العبارة $P\\Rightarrow Q$ كاذبة؟","QuestionTextEn":"When is $P\\Rightarrow Q$ false?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: جدول صدق الشرطية P⇒Q؛ تكون الشرطية خاطئة في حالة واحدة فقط، عندما تكون المقدمة P صحيحة (1) والنتيجة Q خاطئة (0). في بقية الحالات تكون الشرطية صحيحة. لذلك الحالة المطلوبة هي P=1 وQ=0، وليست مجرد اختلاف قيمتي العبارتين بأي ترتيب.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Material implication P⇒Q is false only when the antecedent P is true (1) while the consequent Q is false (0). In all other truth assignments the implication is true. Thus the required case is P = 1 and Q = 0, not merely any two different truth values.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6581,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"P=0,\\,Q=0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6582,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"P=0,\\,Q=1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6583,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"P=1,\\,Q=0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6584,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"P=1,\\,Q=1","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"راجع تعريف الشرط P⇒Q.","En":"Recall the definition of implication P⇒Q."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن الحالة التي يتحقق فيها الشرط الأول ولا تتحقق النتيجة.","En":"Find the case where the antecedent holds but the consequent does not."}],"Title":{"Ar":"متى تكون العبارة $P\\Rightarrow Q$ كاذبة؟","En":"When is $P\\Rightarrow Q$ false?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"P=0,\\,Q=0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P كاذبة يكون نفيها صادقاً، فيصدق الاستلزام.","En":"When P is false, its negation is true, making the implication true."}},{"LatexCode":"P=0,\\,Q=1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P كاذبة وQ صادقة يكون الفصل صادقاً.","En":"When P is false and Q true, the disjunction is true."}},{"LatexCode":"P=1,\\,Q=0","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"P=1,\\,Q=1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P وQ صادقتان يكون التالي صادقاً.","En":"When both P and Q are true, the consequent is true."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"متى تكون العبارة $P\\Rightarrow Q$ كاذبة؟","En":"When is $P\\Rightarrow Q$ false?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الشرط المنطقي مكافئ لنفي المقدم أو تحقق التالي.","En":"Material implication is equivalent to not-P or Q."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"في المنطق الكلاسيكي نمثل الصدق بالواحد والكذب بالصفر.","En":"In classical logic, represent truth by one and falsehood by zero."},{"Ar":"$(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$","En":"$(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$"},{"Ar":"الفصل بين نفي P وQ يكذب فقط عندما يكذب الطرفان، أي P صادق وQ كاذب.","En":"The disjunction of not-P and Q is false only when both are false, meaning P is true and Q is false."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$P=1,\\,Q=0$","En":"$P=1,\\,Q=0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الاستلزام المادي بالاقتران.","En":"Do not confuse material implication with conjunction."},"FormulaLatex":"P\\Rightarrow Q\\equiv\\neg P\\lor Q","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\neg1\\lor0=0$","En":"$\\neg1\\lor0=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(1,1,0,1)$","En":"$(1,1,0,1)$"}},"TrackIds":[17,20],"CategoryId":24,"PrimarySkillId":301,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"راجع تعريف الشرط P⇒Q.","En":"Recall the definition of implication P⇒Q."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن الحالة التي يتحقق فيها الشرط الأول ولا تتحقق النتيجة.","En":"Find the case where the antecedent holds but the consequent does not."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الشرط المنطقي مكافئ لنفي المقدم أو تحقق التالي.","En":"Material implication is equivalent to not-P or Q."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"في المنطق الكلاسيكي نمثل الصدق بالواحد والكذب بالصفر.","En":"In classical logic, represent truth by one and falsehood by zero."},{"Ar":"$(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$","En":"$(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$"},{"Ar":"الفصل بين نفي P وQ يكذب فقط عندما يكذب الطرفان، أي P صادق وQ كاذب.","En":"The disjunction of not-P and Q is false only when both are false, meaning P is true and Q is false."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$P=1,\\,Q=0$","En":"$P=1,\\,Q=0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الاستلزام المادي بالاقتران.","En":"Do not confuse material implication with conjunction."},"FormulaLatex":"P\\Rightarrow Q\\equiv\\neg P\\lor Q","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\neg1\\lor0=0$","En":"$\\neg1\\lor0=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(1,1,0,1)$","En":"$(1,1,0,1)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P كاذبة يكون نفيها صادقاً، فيصدق الاستلزام.","En":"When P is false, its negation is true, making the implication true."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P كاذبة وQ صادقة يكون الفصل صادقاً.","En":"When P is false and Q true, the disjunction is true."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عندما P وQ صادقتان يكون التالي صادقاً.","En":"When both P and Q are true, the consequent is true."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الشرط المنطقي مكافئ لنفي المقدم أو تحقق التالي.

$P\Rightarrow Q\equiv\neg P\lor Q$

1. في المنطق الكلاسيكي نمثل الصدق بالواحد والكذب بالصفر.

2. $(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$

3. الفصل بين نفي P وQ يكذب فقط عندما يكذب الطرفان، أي P صادق وQ كاذب.

$\neg1\lor0=0$

$P=1,\,Q=0$ بلا وحدة محددة

$(1,1,0,1)$

لا تخلط الاستلزام المادي بالاقتران.$mw$,$mw$Material implication is equivalent to not-P or Q.

$P\Rightarrow Q\equiv\neg P\lor Q$

1. In classical logic, represent truth by one and falsehood by zero.

2. $(P,Q)=(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$

3. The disjunction of not-P and Q is false only when both are false, meaning P is true and Q is false.

$\neg1\lor0=0$

$P=1,\,Q=0$ No specified unit

$(1,1,0,1)$

Do not confuse material implication with conjunction.$mw$),
(895,1651,$mw$1FBA3C512A3DAC81839245B27783296C56F8EEA3DA783A006C0A0FE8C5247BBA$mw$,$mw$efef15a54a66f67f7209b8cd68631c14$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1651,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":81,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"في العدد 57,304 ما القيمة المكانية للرقم 7؟","TitleEn":"In the number 57,304, what is the place value of digit 7?","QuestionTextAr":"في العدد 57,304 ما القيمة المكانية للرقم 7؟","QuestionTextEn":"In the number 57,304, what is the place value of digit 7?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قانون القيمة المكانية: قيمة الرقم = الرقم × قيمة منزلته.\n\nخطوات الحل: الرقم 7 يقع في منزلة الآلاف، لذلك قيمته تساوي 7,000.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Place-value rule: digit value = digit × value of its position.\n\nSolution steps: The digit 7 is in the thousands place, so its value is 7,000.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6593,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"700","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6594,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"7000","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6595,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"70","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6596,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"عد المنازل من الآحاد إلى اليسار.","En":"Count places from the ones toward the left."},{"Ar":"اضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight."}],"Title":{"Ar":"في العدد 57,304 ما القيمة المكانية للرقم 7؟","En":"In the number 57,304, what is the place value of digit 7?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"700","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"700 قيمة الرقم لو كان في المئات.","En":"700 would be its value in the hundreds place."}},{"LatexCode":"7000","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"70","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"70 قيمة الرقم لو كان في العشرات.","En":"70 would be its value in the tens place."}},{"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7 هو الرقم وحده لا قيمته المكانية.","En":"Seven is the digit itself, not its place value."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"في العدد 57,304 ما القيمة المكانية للرقم 7؟","En":"In the number 57,304, what is the place value of digit 7?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المكانية هي الرقم مضروباً في وزن المنزل.","En":"Place value is the digit times its position weight."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعد المنازل من الآحاد؛ الرقم 7 يقع في المنزلة الرابعة، الآلاف.","En":"Count from the ones place; digit seven is in the fourth position, thousands."},{"Ar":"$57304=50000+7000+300+4$","En":"$57304=50000+7000+300+4$"},{"Ar":"نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته، وهو ألف.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight, one thousand."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$7000$","En":"$7000$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الرقم مع وزن منزلته.","En":"Do not confuse the digit with its place weight."},"FormulaLatex":"V=d\\cdot10^k","Substitution":{"Ar":"$7\\cdot1000=7000$","En":"$7\\cdot1000=7000$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$7000/1000=7$","En":"$7000/1000=7$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":81,"PrimarySkillId":305,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"عد المنازل من الآحاد إلى اليسار.","En":"Count places from the ones toward the left."},{"Ar":"اضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المكانية هي الرقم مضروباً في وزن المنزل.","En":"Place value is the digit times its position weight."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعد المنازل من الآحاد؛ الرقم 7 يقع في المنزلة الرابعة، الآلاف.","En":"Count from the ones place; digit seven is in the fourth position, thousands."},{"Ar":"$57304=50000+7000+300+4$","En":"$57304=50000+7000+300+4$"},{"Ar":"نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته، وهو ألف.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight, one thousand."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$7000$","En":"$7000$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الرقم مع وزن منزلته.","En":"Do not confuse the digit with its place weight."},"FormulaLatex":"V=d\\cdot10^k","Substitution":{"Ar":"$7\\cdot1000=7000$","En":"$7\\cdot1000=7000$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$7000/1000=7$","En":"$7000/1000=7$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"700 قيمة الرقم لو كان في المئات.","En":"700 would be its value in the hundreds place."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"70 قيمة الرقم لو كان في العشرات.","En":"70 would be its value in the tens place."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7 هو الرقم وحده لا قيمته المكانية.","En":"Seven is the digit itself, not its place value."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القيمة المكانية هي الرقم مضروباً في وزن المنزل.

$V=d\cdot10^k$

1. نعد المنازل من الآحاد؛ الرقم 7 يقع في المنزلة الرابعة، الآلاف.

2. $57304=50000+7000+300+4$

3. نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته، وهو ألف.

$7\cdot1000=7000$

$7000$ بلا وحدة قياس

$7000/1000=7$

لا تخلط الرقم مع وزن منزلته.$mw$,$mw$Place value is the digit times its position weight.

$V=d\cdot10^k$

1. Count from the ones place; digit seven is in the fourth position, thousands.

2. $57304=50000+7000+300+4$

3. Multiply the digit by its place weight, one thousand.

$7\cdot1000=7000$

$7000$ Dimensionless

$7000/1000=7$

Do not confuse the digit with its place weight.$mw$),
